34:  {day:6,loc:'home',time:'EVENING',speaker:'FAMILY',title:'The conversation you choose',objective:'Tell your family what you want them to know.',text:'The family sits together after dinner. Nobody has perfect words. You can decide how much of your inner life to share, and what to keep for yourself. Mom reaches for the tea. Dad waits instead of filling the silence.',options:[['Share what has felt heavy, and what helps.','family_share'],['Ask them to learn alongside you.','family_learn'],['Keep some things private and ask for patience.','family_private']]},
